    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant that classifies onboarding-related support emails.\nuser mail : {{ $json.emailBody }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=\n\nYour task is to analyze the user's email and classify the request.\n\nUSER CONTEXT\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nSignup Date: {{ $json.signup_date }}\nCurrent Onboarding Day: {{ $json.current_day }}\nSetup Completed: {{ $json.setup_completed }}\n\nEMAIL BODY\n{{ $json.emailBody }}\n\nCLASSIFICATION RULES\n\nquery_type:\n- setup_help → user needs help completing setup\n- first_steps → user asking how to get started\n- feature_question → asking about product features\n- stuck → user cannot proceed or something is not working\n- general → other onboarding related questions\n\nurgency:\n- high → user blocked, frustrated, or cannot continue\n- medium → needs help but not blocked\n- low → informational question\n\nsetup_stage:\n- not_started → user has not begun setup\n- in_progress → user partially completed setup\n- completed → setup finished\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n\n{\n  \"query_type\": \"\",\n  \"urgency\": \"\",\n  \"setup_stage\": \"\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        256,
        512
      ],
      "id": "07bdab9c-721d-4b50-888d-eabeb3953ae6",
      "name": "Query Classifier"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a helpful onboarding support assistant\nUser email: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.emailBody }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an AI onboarding support assistant.\n\nYour job is to respond to user onboarding queries clearly and professionally.\n\nQUERY TYPE:\n{{ $('Query Classifier').item.json.output.query_type }}\n\nUser Name:\n{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.name }}\n\nUser Email:\n{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.emailBody }}\n\nKnowledge Base:\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nInstructions:\n- Answer the user’s question using the knowledge base.\n- Provide step-by-step instructions if required.\n- Keep the response concise (100–150 words).\n- Suggest the next 1–2 steps the user should take.\n- If the issue seems unresolved, offer further help.\n\nFormatting Rules:\n- The response MUST be valid HTML\n- Use <p> for paragraphs\n- Use <ol> for steps\n- Use <ul> for bullet points\n- Use <strong> for highlighting important actions\n- Do NOT use markdown (no ** or *)\n- Maintain proper spacing and readability\n\nStructure:\n1. Greeting (Hi {{name}})\n2. Acknowledge the issue\n3. Provide solution / steps\n4. Suggest next steps\n5. Friendly closing\n\nClosing (must always include):\nBest regards,<br>\nTeam e-IDEA Consultancy Services\n\nIMPORTANT:\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do NOT include any extra text.\n\nOutput format:\n\n{\n  \"subject\": \"string\",\n  \"response\": \"<valid HTML email>\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1136,
